    <bpmn:process id="W_W5154" name="W5154. ERP Item Master Plastic/Packaging Weight Fields Configuration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Approved plastic baseline audit (W5153); new product creation process (VS-01.1)
Frequency: Continuous per new SKU onboarding
Volume: ~1,500–2,500 new SKUs configured annually (new-SKU canon)
Owner: Master Data Manager
Participants: Master Data Analysts (VS-29), Product Developers (VS-41), Category Managers (VS-01)
Source: workflow W5154 — ERP Item Master Plastic/Packaging Weight Fields Configuration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5154_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5154_Lane1" name="Master Data Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5154_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5154_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5154_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5154_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5154_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5154_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5154_Start3" name="Approved plastic baseline audit (W5153); new product creation process (VS-01.1)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5154_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5154_Task4" name="Configure new fields in the ERP Item Master for packaging material type, unit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Configure new fields in the ERP Item Master for packaging material type, unit packaging weight (grams), and recycling tier.
Responsible (R): Master Data Manager
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5154_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5154_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5154_Task5" name="Update the product onboarding workflow: require suppliers to fill in packaging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Update the product onboarding workflow: require suppliers to fill in packaging weight fields before SKU generation approval.
Responsible (R): Master Data Manager
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5154_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5154_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5154_Task6" name="Run data purification campaigns to fill in missing packaging fields for legacy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Run data purification campaigns to fill in missing packaging fields for legacy SKUs.
Responsible (R): Master Data Manager
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5154_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5154_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5154_Task7" name="Perform monthly system checks to ensure new SKUs have completed packaging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Perform monthly system checks to ensure new SKUs have completed packaging metadata fields.
Responsible (R): Master Data Manager
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5154_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5154_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5154_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5154_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5154_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-767 (ensure controlled execution — Plastic Footprint Auditing, ERP Packaging Modeling &amp; Registration (PA-179.1).) | - CTL-767: Master data validation rules prevent SKU creation without packaging weight verification.
Owner: Master Data Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
