    <bpmn:process id="W_W5155" name="W5155. Inbound Supplier Plastic/Packaging Certification Audit" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New vendor onboarding (VS-03.1); annual vendor audit cycle (VS-25.2)
Frequency: Continuous + annual audit
Volume: ~800–1,000 active vendors audited annually
Owner: Vendor Compliance Lead / Quality Assurance Manager (VS-31)
Participants: Procurement Specialists (VS-03), Sustainability team, Vendor
Source: workflow W5155 — Inbound Supplier Plastic/Packaging Certification Audit</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5155_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5155_Lane1" name="Vendor Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5155_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5155_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5155_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5155_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5155_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5155_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5155_Start3" name="New vendor onboarding (VS-03.1); annual vendor audit cycle (VS-25.2)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5155_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5155_Task4" name="Send packaging declaration forms and compliance guidelines to prospective and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Send packaging declaration forms and compliance guidelines to prospective and active suppliers.
Responsible (R): Vendor Compliance Lead / Quality Assurance Manager (VS-31)
Accountable (A): Vendor Compliance Lead / Quality Assurance Manager (VS-31)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5155_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5155_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5155_Task5" name="Request official laboratory certification or material safety data sheets (MSDS)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Request official laboratory certification or material safety data sheets (MSDS) detailing packaging composition.
Responsible (R): Vendor Compliance Lead / Quality Assurance Manager (VS-31)
Accountable (A): Vendor Compliance Lead / Quality Assurance Manager (VS-31)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5155_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5155_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5155_Task6" name="Perform sample measurements: weigh plastic components of vendor shipments…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Perform sample measurements: weigh plastic components of vendor shipments during DC receiving audits.
Responsible (R): Vendor Compliance Lead / Quality Assurance Manager (VS-31)
Accountable (A): Vendor Compliance Lead / Quality Assurance Manager (VS-31)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5155_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5155_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5155_Task7" name="Score vendor compliance: calculate discrepancy between declared packaging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Score vendor compliance: calculate discrepancy between declared packaging weight and actual audited weight.
Responsible (R): Vendor Compliance Lead / Quality Assurance Manager (VS-31)
Accountable (A): Vendor Compliance Lead / Quality Assurance Manager (VS-31)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5155_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5155_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5155_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5155_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5155_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-170 (ensure EPR recovery &amp; registration compliance.) | - CTL-767: Vendor compliance score integrated into vendor scorecard (VS-67); discrepancy alerts triggered.
Owner: Vendor Compliance Lead / Quality Assurance Manager (VS-31)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
