    <bpmn:process id="W_W5160" name="W5160. EPR Budgeting, Cost Allocation &amp; Plastic Fee Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual corporate budget cycle (VS-33); monthly close calculations
Frequency: Annual budgeting + monthly allocation
Volume: ~PHP 10M–25M annual recovery budget
Owner: Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller / EPR Compliance Manager
Participants: Finance FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Category Managers (VS-01), VP Merchandising
Source: workflow W5160 — EPR Budgeting, Cost Allocation &amp; Plastic Fee Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5160_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5160_Lane1" name="Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5160_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5160_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5160_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5160_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5160_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5160_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5160_Start3" name="Annual corporate budget cycle (VS-33); monthly close calculations">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5160_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5160_Task4" name="Estimate annual EPR compliance cost: compute PRO fees, partner recovery fees…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Estimate annual EPR compliance cost: compute PRO fees, partner recovery fees, logistics costs, and audit fees based on footprint forecast.
Responsible (R): Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller / EPR Compliance Manager
Accountable (A): Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller / EPR Compliance Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5160_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5160_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5160_Task5" name="Create cost allocation model: allocate EPR expenses to departments/categories…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Create cost allocation model: allocate EPR expenses to departments/categories based on their plastic packaging footprint share.
Responsible (R): Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller / EPR Compliance Manager
Accountable (A): Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller / EPR Compliance Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5160_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5160_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5160_Task6" name="Integrate plastic fees into private label product costing sheets as an overhead…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Integrate plastic fees into private label product costing sheets as an overhead landed cost component (VS-158).
Responsible (R): Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller / EPR Compliance Manager
Accountable (A): Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller / EPR Compliance Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5160_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5160_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5160_Task7" name="Review monthly actual EPR spending against budget; adjust category…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Review monthly actual EPR spending against budget; adjust category cost-allocations.
Responsible (R): Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller / EPR Compliance Manager
Accountable (A): Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller / EPR Compliance Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5160_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5160_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5160_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5160_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5160_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-767 (ensure controlled execution — Plastic Footprint Auditing, ERP Packaging Modeling &amp; Registration (PA-179.1).) | - CTL-767: Allocation approved by Controller; monthly variance reporting shared with VP Merchandising.
Owner: Real Estate &amp; Operations Controller / EPR Compliance Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
